            <h1 class="gh-article-title is-title">NVIDIA DLSS 5 is in NBA 2K27. Does your GPU need replacing?</h1>
                <p class="gh-article-excerpt is-body">NBA 2K27 recommends an RTX 2070, but local DLSS 5 neural rendering needs RTX 50 hardware. A practical look at costs, compatibility and FPS claims.</p>

