            <figcaption>RTX 5090 Founders Edition, photographed in January 2025; one example of supported RTX 50 hardware, not a requirement to buy this model. Still: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5nj1qLazPlk">ZMASLO</a> via <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:RTX_5090_-_du%C5%BCa_wydajno%C5%9B%C4%87_du%C5%BCym_kosztem_(2160p_30fps_VP9_LQ-96kbit_AAC)-00.00.05.900.png">Wikimedia Commons</a>, <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/">CC BY 3.0</a>. Unmodified.</figcaption>
