                <h3 class="gh-card-title is-title">LX Semicon Q3 2026: Operating Loss of KRW 15.6B as Revenue Falls 15%</h3>
                <p class="gh-card-excerpt is-body">LX Semicon filed preliminary third-quarter 2026 results with revenue of KRW 336.0 billion, down 14.8% year over year, and an operating loss of KRW 15.6 billion. The board also named Jun-ho Na as its next CEO on the same day.</p>
