            </figure>
        <div class="gh-card-wrapper">
            <p class="gh-card-tag" lang="en">Analysis
</p>
                <h3 class="gh-card-title is-title">The Coldest Cooling Does Not Win: Liquid Cooling in AI Data Centers and the Operations Threshold</h3>
                <p class="gh-card-excerpt is-body">Liquid cooling&#x27;s winner will not be the coldest method. Once racks pass 20 kW, cold plates lead immersion not on thermal performance but on retrofit, maintenance, and fluid supply — the operations threshold.</p>
            <footer class="gh-card-meta">
<!--
             -->
                    <span class="gh-card-author">By Chase Na 나경채</span>
