<section class="vk-cookie-consent" id="vk-cookie-consent" role="dialog" aria-modal="false" aria-labelledby="vk-cookie-consent-title" hidden>
    <div class="vk-cookie-consent-inner">
        <span class="vk-cookie-consent-kicker">PRIVACY CONTROL</span>
        <div class="vk-cookie-consent-copy">
            <strong id="vk-cookie-consent-title"><span class="vk-lang-ko">쿠키 사용을 선택해 주세요.</span><span class="vk-lang-other">Choose your cookie preference.</span></strong>
            <p><span class="vk-lang-ko">회원 가입과 Ghost의 쿠키 없는 1차 통계는 동의 없이도 작동합니다. 동의 전 Google Analytics는 쿠키와 식별자 없이 기본 측정만 하고, 동의하면 Google Analytics와 Google 광고, Trivet 유입 측정, 푸시 알림, TradingView 시세 위젯을 사용합니다. 거부하면 Google 태그 요청 자체를 보내지 않습니다.</span><span class="vk-lang-other">Membership signup and Ghost's cookie-free first-party analytics work without consent. Before you choose, Google Analytics runs in a cookie-free basic measurement mode with no identifiers stored; accepting enables full Google Analytics and advertising, Trivet attribution, push notifications, and the TradingView market widget. Declining blocks Google tag requests entirely.</span></p>
        </div>
        <div class="vk-cookie-consent-actions">
            <button type="button" class="vk-cookie-button is-reject" data-vk-cookie-choice="rejected"><span class="vk-lang-ko">거부</span><span class="vk-lang-other">Reject</span></button>
            <button type="button" class="vk-cookie-button is-accept" data-vk-cookie-choice="accepted"><span class="vk-lang-ko">동의</span><span class="vk-lang-other">Accept</span></button>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<script data-cfasync="false" src="/cdn-cgi/scripts/5c5dd728/cloudflare-static/email-decode.min.js"></script><script data-vk-consent-ui="early">
(function () {
    if (!document.querySelector('main.vk-front-page.vk-editorial')) return;
    var consent = window.VLSIConsent;
    var banner = document.getElementById('vk-cookie-consent');
    if (!consent || !banner || banner.dataset.vkConsentUiReady) return;
    banner.dataset.vkConsentUiReady = 'true';
    var choices = banner.querySelectorAll('[data-vk-cookie-choice]');
    function show() {
        banner.hidden = false;
        document.documentElement.classList.add('has-cookie-consent');
        var choice = consent.get();
        choices.forEach(function (button) {
            button.setAttribute('aria-pressed', button.dataset.vkCookieChoice === choice ? 'true' : 'false');
        });
    }
    choices.forEach(function (button) {
        button.addEventListener('click', function () {
            consent.set(button.dataset.vkCookieChoice);
            banner.hidden = true;
            document.documentElement.classList.remove('has-cookie-consent');
        });
    });
    document.querySelectorAll('[data-vk-cookie-settings]').forEach(function (button) {
        button.addEventListener('click', function () {
            show();
            window.setTimeout(function () {
                (banner.querySelector('[aria-pressed="true"]') || choices[0]).focus();
            }, 0);
        });
    });
    if (consent.get() === 'unset') {
        // Geo-split (2026-11-01): visitors outside the EEA + UK never see
        // the banner — analytics is granted automatically for them. Wait for
        // the bootstrap's region resolution before deciding to show; EEA/UK
        // and any resolution failure keep the previous behavior. The manual
        // Cookie settings button above still opens the banner everywhere.
        if (consent.ready && typeof consent.ready.then === 'function') {
            consent.ready.then(function () {
                var region = typeof consent.region === 'function' ? consent.region() : '';
                if (region !== 'auto' && consent.get() === 'unset') show();
            });
        } else {
            show();
        }
    }
}());
</script>
