    <label for="vk-signup-language" data-vk-member-copy="language">선호하는 콘텐츠 언어</label>
    <select id="vk-signup-language" data-vk-profile="language" required>
      <option value="ko">한국어</option><option value="en">English</option><option value="zh">中文</option><option value="ja">日本語</option><option value="es">Español</option><option value="vi">Tiếng Việt</option><option value="ar">العربية</option><option value="he">עברית</option><option value="ms">Bahasa Melayu</option>
    </select>
    <input type="hidden" data-members-label value="language:ko" data-vk-label="language">
    <input type="hidden" data-members-label data-vk-language-lock value="lang:ko">
    <label for="vk-signup-delivery" data-vk-member-copy="delivery">지금 받을 뉴스레터 언어</label>
    <select id="vk-signup-delivery"><option value="ko">한국어</option><option value="en">English</option></select>
    <input type="hidden" data-members-label data-vk-newsletter-label value="newsletter:ko">
    <input type="hidden" data-members-newsletter value="VLSI Korea — 한국어">
    <p class="vk-signup-terms" data-vk-delivery-note hidden>선호 언어는 앞으로의 뉴스레터 기획에 반영합니다. 현재 발송 중인 한국어·영어 중 수신 언어를 따로 선택해 주세요.</p>
    <details class="vk-signup-profile"><summary data-vk-member-copy="optional">관심 분야와 직업 (선택)</summary>
      <fieldset class="vk-signup-interests"><legend data-vk-member-copy="interests">관심 분야 · 여러 개 선택 가능</legend><label class="vk-interest-option"><input type="checkbox" value="chip-design" data-vk-interest><span data-vk-interest-copy="chip-design">칩 설계 · EDA</span></label><label class="vk-interest-option"><input type="checkbox" value="manufacturing" data-vk-interest><span data-vk-interest-copy="manufacturing">파운드리 · 공정 · 장비</span></label><label class="vk-interest-option"><input type="checkbox" value="memory-packaging" data-vk-interest><span data-vk-interest-copy="memory-packaging">메모리 · 패키징</span></label><label class="vk-interest-option"><input type="checkbox" value="ai-infrastructure" data-vk-interest><span data-vk-interest-copy="ai-infrastructure">AI 칩 · 데이터센터</span></label><label class="vk-interest-option"><input type="checkbox" value="investment" data-vk-interest><span data-vk-interest-copy="investment">실적 · 투자 · 산업 분석</span></label><label class="vk-interest-option"><input type="checkbox" value="papers" data-vk-interest><span data-vk-interest-copy="papers">논문 · 기술 연구</span></label><label class="vk-interest-option"><input type="checkbox" value="career" data-vk-interest><span data-vk-interest-copy="career">커리어 · 교육</span></label><label class="vk-interest-option"><input type="checkbox" value="events" data-vk-interest><span data-vk-interest-copy="events">학회 · 행사</span></label></fieldset><div data-vk-interest-labels></div>
      <label for="vk-signup-job" data-vk-member-copy="job">직군</label>
      <select id="vk-signup-job" data-vk-profile="job-function"><option value="" data-vk-member-copy="skip">선택하지 않음</option><option value="engineering">Engineering</option><option value="research">Research / Academia</option><option value="investment">Investment / Finance</option><option value="product-business">Product / Business</option><option value="student">Student</option><option value="other">Other</option></select>
